---
import "@styles/colors.css";
import "@styles/components.css";
---

<section
    id="about-section"
    class="full-page-section flex-col bg-gray-100 dark:bg-dark-bg-secondary py-32 px-8"
>
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto w-full">
        <p
            class="uppercase tracking-wider text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-dark-text-muted font-medium mb-6"
        >
            About Me
        </p>
        <h2 class="heading-2 mb-8">Engineer. Cyclist. Problem Solver.</h2>

        <div class="max-w-[900px]">
            <p class="text-lead mb-6">
                With over {new Date().getFullYear() - 2020} years of experience in
                software engineering, I specialize in building high-performance web
                apps and AI data pipelines for niche markets. My work spans geospatial
                data for autonomous semi-trucks, multi-UAV control systems, and enterprise
                procurment software — always with a focus on high quality systems
                and thoughtful user experiences.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lead mb-6">
                At Embark Trucks, I certified 500+ miles of US highway data for
                their autonomous vehicle system, contributing to zero on-road
                incidents. I designed and delivered a multi-UAV control system
                10 days before Threshold UAV's debut at AgSmart 2023. I'm
                adaptable, self-motivated, and have a strong track record of
                delivering projects on time while exceeding expectations.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lead mb-0">
                When I'm not coding, you'll find me on my bike—whether it's
                grinding up mountain passes, exploring gravel roads, or
                commuting through San Francisco. Cycling has taught me patience,
                persistence, and the value of steady progress—principles I bring
                to every project.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shane-au-wade/details/experience/"
                target="_blank"
                class="btn-primary">Experience Timeline</a
            >
            <a
                href="/Shane-Wade-Software Engineer-resume.docx.md"
                target="_blank"
                class="btn-primary">Download Resume</a
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
